    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Lemma 3.2. Let M be an R-module. Suppose that I is an ideal of R and N ∈ mod R such that SuppN ⊂ V (I). Then the following assertions hold for any non-negative integer n."
  }, {
    "type" : "list",
